        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAYCOOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to bring to the market this exceptionally presented property in the highly sought after St Edmunds Park, Lucan, Co Dublin.\n\nSt Edmunds Park is a very popular development on the edge of Lucan close to Liffey valley shopping centre. With primary and secondary schools and a variety of amenities including shops, park and recreational facilities on its doorstep whilst the N4, R113 and M50 are all within easy reach making for easy commuting.\n\nBright, spacious and well maintained living accommodation of c. 150sqm can be found in this incredible property which briefly consists of; Entrance hall, wc, lounge, Open plan kitchen/diner with separate utility room to the ground floor. On the first floor, you will find two double bedrooms, one with ensuite, bedroom 5/study and main family bathroom. The third floor consists of two bedrooms including large master with ensuite and balcony. Externally to the rear you have a fully enclosed SOUTH/WEST facing garden with shed.\n\nNo. 11  comes to the market in turn key condition and fully furnished making it ideal for first time buyers or families looking to upsize. Early viewing is highly advised so contact RAYCOOKE AUCTIONEERS today to register your interest!\n\nFeatures\n4/5 bed 4 bath\nComes furnished\nMid terrace\nSought after development\nImmaculate condition throughout\nBER B2 Qualifying of a green mortgage\nc. 150 Sqm\nClose to liffey Valley Shopping Centre.\nWalking distance to local amenities\n\nCall Ray Cooke today!\n\nDirections\nK78 T103\n"
